holder\"><!----><app-jss-recent-resume-booking class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----></app-jss-recent-resume-booking><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n<div class=\"saudia-destination-wrapper\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n\n<div class=\"saudia-itinerary-box\">\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-row\">\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-content\">\n<h4>In Bodrum, the days seem to unfold around the water. White houses climb the hillsides and wooden boats drift through the marina.</h4>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-image\">\n<img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Media-Center/2026/06/Bodrum_355x200_5.ashx?rev=57c720d0ed8c418ba771e6dcdd3ed201&amp;hash=BC9E6C6EC0502920883AEFD5EC07C29A\" alt=\"Enjoy authentic Omani cuisine and fresh seafood\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-row reverse\">\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-content\">\n<h4>You start in the old streets near Bodrum Castle, where stone walls overlook the harbour. A little further along on the marina, yachts are lined across the water and people are moving slowly between the shops and the sea.</h4>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-image\">\n<img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Media-Center/2026/06/Bodrum_355x200_1.ashx?rev=a7477e397ef344579c1d95ee1c2aa42c&amp;hash=FE8A12994A39E8BC1308C8220E3BDC34\" alt=\"Visit the UNESCO-listed Frankincense Land sites\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-row\">\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-content\">\n<h4>You follow the peninsula outward. In T\u00fcrkb\u00fck\u00fc, you find yourself among the beach clubs set directly on the sea, where you can swim or sunbathe to your heart\u2019s content. Further out, boat trips take you across hidden bays, stopping wherever the water turns still and clear. And around Yal\u0131kavak, the coastline opens wide, giving you long views as the light begins to fade over the hills.</h4>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-image\">\n<img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Media-Center/2026/06/Bodrum_355x200_2.ashx?rev=ed7bd4c623f4448eb4a90ab409d2989c&amp;hash=964AC6181B35362DF9E4E1506CC546BC\" alt=\"Relax at seaside resorts surrounded by nature\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-row reverse\">\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-content\">\n<h4>Later, you take a slow walk along the harbor, watch the boats still arriving and the marina shifting as night builds gradually around it.</h4>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-image\">\n<img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Media-Center/2026/06/Bodrum_355x200_4.ashx?rev=d1639765fe494ecdae0d31997f96546a&amp;hash=BEA22AAEA9DFB0C33B8D892FE6665EAB\" alt=\"Enjoy the misty weather and lush green mountain landscapes\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-row\">\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-content\">\n<h4>The food stays close to the coast around you. Fresh grilled fish brought straight from the sea, Turkish kebabs right from the grill, and some baklava to close the evening.</h4>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"saudia-feature-image\">\n<img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Media-Center/2026/06/Bodrum_355x200_3.ashx?rev=46e7db6453c64bf1b81759b668721fdb&amp;hash=560FF4E2F408A12489E3B1BB7E3C1212\" alt=\"Relax at seaside resorts surrounded by nature\">\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<p>\n   With Saudia, arrive in Bodrum with ease and comfort, and begin a journey between the turquoise sea, elegant marinas, and the tranquil charm of the Turkish coast.\n</p>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-faq class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"faq-section ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.lt-lg=\"column\" fxlayoutgap=\"20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"\">FAQs</h2><!----><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-6 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How far in advance should I book my flight to Bodrum?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"> How far in advance should I book my flight to Bodrum? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-6\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>The best time to book a flight to Bodrum&nbsp;is 3 - 6 months before your date of travel. This would give you the best chance of finding the best prices and timings that fit your schedule.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-9 ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I change or cancel my flight to Bodrum?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-9\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-9\"> Can I change or cancel my flight to Bodrum? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-9 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-8\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Yes, we offer free cancellation on flight to Bodrum&nbsp;subject to our cancellation and refund policy. Read our <a href=\"/en-SA/book-and-manage/manage/refund\">cancellation and refund policy for more information</a>.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-10 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-11 ng-tns-c1859850774-10 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I get extra baggage allowance for flights to Bodrum?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-11\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-11\"> Can I get extra baggage allowance for flights to Bodrum? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-11 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-10 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-10\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>If our standard baggage allowance is not enough, you can add extra baggage to your flight booking at an additional fee.&nbsp;Read more about our <a href=\"/sitecore/service/notfound.aspx?item=web%3a%7b31152426-158B-48D0-8AE9-BADDD086F264%7d%40en-SA\">addition baggage charges</a>.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-theme class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div data-theme-change=\"White\" data-footer-theme-override=\"false\" class=\"themeTransition\"></div></app-jss-theme><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-html-snippet><div><div></div><!----></div></app-jss-html-snippet><!----></sc-placeholder>", "extraMedia": ["/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/NEW2026/summer-campaign-2026/darkened-banners/Bodrum-darkened-mobile-Banner.ashx?h=1200&iar=0&w=1270&rev=a457a1507e4e4b9785eab419f97913ab&hash=3A38229F730A97B5BAAC9D5BF8A9AEAA"]}